    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1754017702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1754017702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1754017702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/72fb94e849dfd6cf4d2387d671bc7aa3.poster.avif?t=1754017702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/72fb94e849dfd6cf4d2387d671bc7aa3.webm?t=1754017702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/72fb94e849dfd6cf4d2387d671bc7aa3.mp4?t=1754017702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/6f738656773767009b439664e5df86a8.webp?t=1754017702\" /></div><br><br>SilkRoad Project is a 3rd person <strong>Character Action Game</strong> All sprinkled with some <strong>Inn Management</strong> mechanics that take place in a unique universe that mixes the cultures of ancient Central Asia with modern techno. The game is largely inspired by ultra-nervous Japanese action games, punctuated by moments of calm, serene relaxation.<br><br><strong>Duo Character Combat</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ultra-nervous in its movement. The concept of blink (short-distance teleportation) is rooted in the principle of movement.<br></li><li> Spirit character management during combat. From a gamer's point of view, you can think of it as a pet. Attack synergy between it and the hero</li></ul><br><strong>Caravanserai Management</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manage a guesthouse in the middle of the desert. Welcome guests and try to meet their needs<br></li><li> A feeling of daily life, where you improve your cocoon, and take pleasure, even when doing nothing and lazing around.</li></ul>",
