i> Spirit character management during combat. From a gamer's point of view, you can think of it as a pet. Attack synergy between it and the hero</li></ul><br><strong>Caravanserai Management</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manage a guesthouse in the middle of the desert. Welcome guests and try to meet their needs<br></li><li> A feeling of daily life, where you improve your cocoon, and take pleasure, even when doing nothing and lazing around.</li></ul>",
